WEBVTT

00:03.790 --> 00:06.000
<b>(Gunslinger)</b>

00:06.000 --> 00:08.750
Looks like it's finally settled.

00:09.330 --> 00:11.420
What kind of weapon can beat this girl?!

00:11.420 --> 00:12.330
What weapon?

00:12.330 --> 00:14.670
WHAT WEAPON?!

00:17.210 --> 00:19.880
I'm going to lure Sion out
and get some inte-

00:23.710 --> 00:25.380
All of you, get behind me!

00:25.380 --> 00:26.330
Huh?

00:27.750 --> 00:29.170
This is bad.

00:29.170 --> 00:33.130
<b>(Consultant)</b>

00:29.670 --> 00:32.580
Perhaps I should change plans now.

00:44.790 --> 00:48.290
What is... happening to me?

00:49.380 --> 00:51.750
60% of your entire body has vanished.

00:52.130 --> 00:53.960
Having difficulties with
immediate recovery.

00:53.960 --> 00:55.830
Falling into stagnation.

00:56.380 --> 00:58.080
Then do something!

00:58.080 --> 00:59.880
There are two options:

00:59.880 --> 01:02.540
Cease current operations and
wait to heal naturally,

01:02.540 --> 01:05.540
or recover completely
using Dragon Heal.

01:05.540 --> 01:09.290
Well that sounds convenient, just do that!

01:09.290 --> 01:10.670
It is not recommended.

01:10.670 --> 01:13.920
Dragon Heal will cause
an irreversible change.

01:13.920 --> 01:14.670
What?!

01:14.670 --> 01:18.500
Complete recovery entails
you changing forms into a dragon.

01:18.500 --> 01:21.500
I don't have time to waste on these things!

01:21.500 --> 01:23.040
Approval received.

01:23.040 --> 01:24.580
Now, recite the words.

01:24.580 --> 01:26.080
Dragon Heal!

03:17.040 --> 03:21.750
<b>"You Should Use Your Power Any Way You Want"</b>

03:17.830 --> 03:20.920
Er... What's going on?

03:20.920 --> 03:23.420
It may have been an annihilation bomb.

03:23.420 --> 03:27.460
It makes a huge explosion, then the heat
and the shockwave blow everything away.

03:27.460 --> 03:29.540
It also scatters nanomachines around.

03:29.540 --> 03:31.500
How the heck do you know all that?!

03:31.880 --> 03:36.880
Well, the second gate is killing
the laws of physics.

03:36.880 --> 03:38.790
I think it's okay,

03:38.790 --> 03:41.580
but now we don't know where
the trial area is anymore.

03:41.580 --> 03:43.500
THAT'S what you're worried about?!

03:44.420 --> 03:47.420
Well. Now I have to continue
getting my revenge.

03:47.420 --> 03:50.670
Have the targets of your revenge
not been eliminated already?

03:50.670 --> 03:53.960
I just need to confirm
they've been killed.

03:53.960 --> 03:55.920
Due to the circumstances of the battle,

03:55.920 --> 03:59.420
your search skills have been
restricted by the Sage.

03:59.420 --> 04:02.580
But there are different measures we may
take now that you have transformed.

04:02.960 --> 04:04.040
What?

04:04.040 --> 04:06.290
You can use Dragon Warrior.

04:11.710 --> 04:14.790
You can entrust the search
and combat to these.

04:23.380 --> 04:25.670
There's something coming!

04:26.750 --> 04:28.080
What are those?

04:30.210 --> 04:31.960
Are they...

04:32.250 --> 04:33.830
Shinozaki-san?!

04:34.460 --> 04:37.040
Five survivors have been discovered.

04:37.040 --> 04:38.500
Get them!

04:45.290 --> 04:47.330
What just happened?!

04:47.330 --> 04:49.540
Stop! Something is strange!

04:49.540 --> 04:51.960
Don't waste any more troops!

04:51.960 --> 04:54.630
This is... this phenomenon is...

04:55.710 --> 04:58.250
It's Alpha Omega...

04:59.040 --> 05:00.580
if this is Phase 2, then...

05:00.580 --> 05:02.630
Why does he recognize us?

05:03.080 --> 05:05.460
Due to your irreversible
transformation into a dragon,

05:05.460 --> 05:08.920
it is possible that the recognition
blocking function has been suspended.

05:08.920 --> 05:11.330
What are you all talking about?

05:11.330 --> 05:14.250
We are a next-generation human project,

05:14.250 --> 05:18.130
created in the event that humanity has
been annihilated by Alpha Omega.

05:18.130 --> 05:21.210
To that end, we have been
equipped with a function where

05:21.210 --> 05:23.830
an Alpha Omega with liberated powers
cannot recognize us.

05:24.170 --> 05:26.040
We must leave this place now!

05:26.040 --> 05:28.130
What? We're retreating?!

05:28.130 --> 05:30.130
I went so far as to become this

05:30.130 --> 05:32.170
so I could continue getting
my revenge, you know!

05:32.170 --> 05:34.420
That target is right there!

05:34.420 --> 05:36.630
We can't just ignore him!

05:36.630 --> 05:39.750
What else am I even here for!

05:39.750 --> 05:43.210
There's something else on the way!

05:43.210 --> 05:46.290
Huh? It looks just like that thing

05:46.290 --> 05:48.920
that attacked the bus
when we just got to this world...

05:48.920 --> 05:50.000
Die!

05:50.000 --> 05:50.880
Stop this!

05:50.000 --> 05:50.880
Die!

05:50.880 --> 05:52.580
Do not aim your intent to kill at him!

05:50.880 --> 05:52.580
Die!

05:53.040 --> 05:54.080
Die.

05:59.250 --> 06:01.250
Personality unit has been lost!

06:01.250 --> 06:05.420
The fact we are still functioning
shows that there is some effectiveness

06:05.420 --> 06:08.880
in the multiplicity of
completely independent units.

06:08.880 --> 06:14.040
It is a pity that we're unable to convey
this outcome to anyone...

06:16.000 --> 06:19.710
Ah, so it was Shinozaki-san.

06:20.710 --> 06:22.000
Oh, is it?

06:22.000 --> 06:24.670
We still don't know
what's going to happen!

06:24.670 --> 06:28.040
But I've prepared myself for the worst,
so let's get going!

06:28.040 --> 06:29.670
Then let's go.

06:36.250 --> 06:38.250
There's not really anything here...

06:38.250 --> 06:40.080
Since everything is such a mess,

06:40.080 --> 06:43.420
I doubt even the Sage knows
what's going on here.

06:43.710 --> 06:45.880
I understand it all perfectly.

06:45.880 --> 06:46.920
What the-?!

06:46.920 --> 06:48.630
You're Sion the Sage?

06:48.630 --> 06:53.290
Hey! Shouldn't you consider
how you're talking to her?

06:53.290 --> 06:57.500
Yes! And you are
Yogiri Takatou-san?

06:57.830 --> 07:00.750
I hear you're going to wipe me out...

07:04.540 --> 07:07.420
I'm not here to chat with you.

07:07.420 --> 07:09.670
Just answer my questions.

07:09.670 --> 07:12.500
I don't know what's going on right now!

07:12.500 --> 07:14.880
I killed her left ankle.

07:14.880 --> 07:16.880
All my practice has paid off.

07:17.250 --> 07:19.790
Hey, are you listening?

07:19.790 --> 07:22.920
Time to stop zoning out and answer me.

07:26.000 --> 07:28.750
Stop doing all of that stuff.

07:28.750 --> 07:30.790
I could kill you by accident.

07:30.790 --> 07:32.000
Wha-?!

07:32.000 --> 07:34.040
Just so you know,

07:34.040 --> 07:37.710
using an instant death technique to
make my heart stop won't work.

07:38.290 --> 07:40.420
You would die before you use it.

07:40.420 --> 07:44.290
What I want to know is how to
get back to our original world.

07:44.290 --> 07:48.460
I figured you'd have the highest chance
of knowing since you brought us here.

07:54.290 --> 07:56.880
I'll keep picking off pieces of you
until you talk.

08:00.000 --> 08:02.960
Hey! Did you just let her escape?!

08:02.960 --> 08:07.420
Since she came out of nowhere,
she can probably teleport out of here too!

08:07.420 --> 08:08.830
It's fine.

08:14.920 --> 08:17.170
What is that?

08:22.130 --> 08:24.880
I don't have a single clue
as to what's going on.

08:27.920 --> 08:30.630
I'll keep picking off pieces of you
until you talk.

08:31.250 --> 08:32.880
This is absurd!

08:32.880 --> 08:35.710
If you're going to kill me either way
then why would I speak?!

08:36.790 --> 08:38.540
Sion?! What's wrong?!

08:38.540 --> 08:40.000
Youichi-kun...

08:46.170 --> 08:47.460
Youichi-kun!

08:47.920 --> 08:50.380
My hands... and my feet!

08:50.670 --> 08:52.710
Oh no... Why...

08:53.170 --> 08:55.540
Sion, help me!

09:01.420 --> 09:04.080
Spare Youichi-kun.

09:05.000 --> 09:07.460
I just want to talk.

09:07.460 --> 09:10.630
I won't attack you anymore if you do.

09:12.460 --> 09:14.670
I think you already know,

09:14.670 --> 09:17.210
but I can attack you
no matter where you go,

09:17.210 --> 09:19.750
and I can attack any allies you see.

09:19.750 --> 09:22.130
What you're saying is just too scary!

09:22.130 --> 09:23.170
Huh?

09:23.170 --> 09:25.630
Does that apply to what I see as well?

09:25.630 --> 09:28.290
You're not my target, Hanakawa.

09:28.290 --> 09:32.630
Er, I'm a little freaked out by this,
not gonna lie...

09:32.630 --> 09:35.960
We should be glad that this is
the worst he'll do.

09:35.960 --> 09:40.170
Yeah, I'm gradually understanding
what you meant, Ryouko.

09:40.500 --> 09:42.920
Tell me how to go back home.

09:44.080 --> 09:46.080
There currently is no way.

09:46.420 --> 09:48.580
He said that when he came here before,

09:48.580 --> 09:49.130
What?

09:48.580 --> 09:49.130
He said that when he came here before,

09:49.130 --> 09:51.500
he was able to go home then.

09:52.080 --> 09:54.500
That may have been while
there was still a link

09:54.500 --> 09:56.710
stretching between this world and yours.

09:56.880 --> 09:59.920
And you're saying we no longer
have a link?

09:59.920 --> 10:06.170
Yes. When there is a link,
this world is weaker for it.

10:07.880 --> 10:11.210
Okay, tell me the coordinates of our world.

10:13.830 --> 10:14.380
That's long!

10:14.380 --> 10:14.790
There it is!

10:14.380 --> 10:14.790
That's long!

10:14.790 --> 10:15.880
There it is!

10:15.880 --> 10:17.330
I'll remember it!

10:17.330 --> 10:18.790
So, whaddaya think, huh?

10:18.790 --> 10:20.500
I can be useful too!

10:20.500 --> 10:23.920
If you want to go home,
you'll need my power too!

10:23.920 --> 10:25.330
Yeah, sure.

10:23.920 --> 10:25.330
If you want to go home,
you'll need my power too!

10:25.540 --> 10:28.330
So, we can go home if we
have the coordinates,

10:28.330 --> 10:29.960
and the energy necessary?

10:29.960 --> 10:31.960
Do you have any idea about the energy?

10:35.000 --> 10:36.790
The Philosopher's Stone...

10:37.210 --> 10:39.040
I don't think you can do it with
just this one here, though.

10:39.040 --> 10:42.210
If you have several of them,
it may be enough to get you home.

10:42.210 --> 10:44.750
You're willing to give it up?

10:44.750 --> 10:45.790
Yes.

10:45.790 --> 10:49.920
I've never relied on things like this.

10:50.250 --> 10:52.710
Oh. Then I'll be taking it.

10:54.580 --> 10:59.040
Does that mean all the Sages
I've killed up to now also had stones?

10:59.040 --> 10:59.830
Yes.

10:59.830 --> 11:02.500
However, in the case that
they were killed by you,

11:02.500 --> 11:05.330
I hear that the stone in their body
loses power.

11:05.330 --> 11:08.580
The stone is the source of
the Sage's immortality, after all.

11:08.750 --> 11:11.130
That's gonna take forever.

11:11.130 --> 11:13.080
Where are the other Sages?

11:13.080 --> 11:16.830
I don't necessarily know
where all of them are.

11:17.040 --> 11:19.250
Ah okay, I see, I see...

11:17.040 --> 11:19.250
This comes first, I guess.

11:19.250 --> 11:21.630
Ah okay, I see, I see...

11:19.250 --> 11:21.630
Hanakawa. What happened to the exit?

11:21.630 --> 11:22.500
Hanakawa. What happened to the exit?

11:22.500 --> 11:25.790
It's indicated on the map I have...

11:25.790 --> 11:28.460
but you're just going to
leave her like that?!

11:28.460 --> 11:29.710
Sure, why not?

11:29.710 --> 11:32.250
My only goal was to gather intel,

11:32.250 --> 11:36.290
and while I do hate her,
it's not enough to kill her.

11:36.290 --> 11:37.380
Whaaat?!

11:37.380 --> 11:40.920
Even though she's made
our lives a living hell?!

11:42.210 --> 11:45.750
Well don't come crying to me later!

11:51.330 --> 11:54.170
I must tend to Youichi-kun right away!

12:05.580 --> 12:07.130
What could that be?

12:07.130 --> 12:08.960
I have to get back, now!

12:11.170 --> 12:12.580
I can't teleport?

12:14.500 --> 12:16.000
What is this?!

12:16.670 --> 12:20.420
I thought my immune system
was reacting to something,

12:20.790 --> 12:24.130
but turns out it's just a fly
that calls herself a Sage.

12:24.420 --> 12:27.750
I see. Are you a Dark God?

12:31.170 --> 12:34.040
The Sage's test is supposed
to be incredibly difficult,

12:34.040 --> 12:36.330
but this may have been a mistake.

12:36.830 --> 12:37.830
Wha-?!

12:38.380 --> 12:40.210
Battlesong?

12:40.420 --> 12:44.540
You came up with that make-believe system
and you call yourself a Sage?

12:45.040 --> 12:47.330
How absolutely precious.

12:47.580 --> 12:50.040
All my abilities have been disabled!

12:50.040 --> 12:54.040
Even a fly will help the diversity.

12:54.040 --> 12:57.040
Come and nourish my big brother, okay?

12:57.040 --> 12:58.460
What are you...

13:00.960 --> 13:03.630
I can't do a thing.

13:04.710 --> 13:06.420
If that's the case, then...

13:07.330 --> 13:09.250
Yogiri Takatou.

13:09.250 --> 13:11.540
Remember that name.

13:12.210 --> 13:15.210
It's the name of the person
who will kill you.

13:15.580 --> 13:18.080
Yogiri Takatou...

13:19.210 --> 13:21.330
Youichi-kun.

14:23.170 --> 14:24.750
This is looking very bad.

14:24.750 --> 14:26.500
Please, get out of here quickly!

14:26.500 --> 14:30.580
But my role as a royal
exists for times like this.

14:36.830 --> 14:38.000
Whoa!

14:38.000 --> 14:40.580
You truly were worthy of becoming
the Swordmaster!

14:40.580 --> 14:41.630
Oh, no...

14:41.630 --> 14:44.460
I'm afraid I'm not having
much of an impact.

14:46.880 --> 14:51.130
Is this... from when the Sage candidates
broke the seal of the Dark God?

15:00.830 --> 15:03.380
Mana-sama has been resurrected!

15:03.380 --> 15:07.080
She has fulfilled her manifestation
upon the earth!

15:07.080 --> 15:08.880
Bishop Holaris!

15:11.130 --> 15:12.750
What in the world...

15:12.750 --> 15:14.130
Who are you?!

15:14.130 --> 15:16.460
How is it you can use a shortcut?!

15:16.460 --> 15:17.500
Die.

15:19.580 --> 15:23.040
Whoa! Why did you kill him
straight off the bat?!

15:23.040 --> 15:25.040
Because I felt his intent to kill.

15:25.040 --> 15:27.960
No, no, no! I've heard things that
give the impression that he has

15:27.960 --> 15:30.580
a connection to the Dark God
even though he's an Archbishop!

15:30.580 --> 15:31.250
Huh?

15:31.250 --> 15:32.830
Maybe if we'd asked about it,

15:32.830 --> 15:36.790
he'd start blabbing about the magnificent
foundations of their evil master plan!

15:36.790 --> 15:37.960
So what?

15:37.960 --> 15:40.960
I'm starting to think Hanakawa should
take over the Straight Man role

15:37.960 --> 15:40.960
Have a little more interest in serious situations!

15:40.960 --> 15:42.170
in our comedy duo...

15:40.960 --> 15:42.170
Gah! You dumbass!

15:42.170 --> 15:42.790
Gah! You dumbass!

15:42.790 --> 15:45.000
And where are we now?

15:45.000 --> 15:48.000
I think we're somewhere in
the Seat of the Divine King.

15:48.960 --> 15:50.210
What is that?!

15:50.210 --> 15:52.880
It's trying to climb
over the walls, isn't it?

15:58.710 --> 16:01.500
I-I-I think this is my fault!

16:01.500 --> 16:03.960
I truly had no choice then!

16:03.960 --> 16:05.460
What is it?!

16:05.460 --> 16:08.580
She's the Dark God who was at
the bottom of the Underworld.

16:08.580 --> 16:12.130
This all happened because
I broke the seal there...

16:12.130 --> 16:15.330
This is why you were trying to
rush out of here, huh?

16:15.330 --> 16:18.710
Well, that's gonna make
moving around kind of annoying.

16:18.710 --> 16:21.920
THAT'S the biggest problem
you see right now?!

16:22.710 --> 16:27.040
Is it just me, or are they all
starting to congregate around us?

16:27.460 --> 16:30.710
Ah, Hanakawa-san, was it?

16:30.710 --> 16:32.420
Such perfect timing.

16:32.750 --> 16:34.500
What? You two know each other?

16:35.830 --> 16:39.460
Mana-sama?
Is there something you need?!

16:39.750 --> 16:44.710
Guide me to Yogiri Takatou,
the one who killed my big brother.

16:44.710 --> 16:45.670
Yes ma'am!

16:45.670 --> 16:46.790
Here he is!

16:46.790 --> 16:49.710
The one standing next to me, that's him!

16:50.040 --> 16:51.080
You little...

16:51.080 --> 16:52.670
Hanakawa-kun, really?

16:52.670 --> 16:56.170
You are the one who killed
my brother, yes?

16:56.380 --> 16:58.080
You could say that, I guess.

16:58.420 --> 16:59.670
Then die.

16:59.670 --> 17:01.210
No, you die.

17:09.250 --> 17:10.380
Well, of course.

17:10.380 --> 17:13.170
Why would anything pose a threat
to you at this point, eh?

17:13.330 --> 17:15.830
You are simply amazing, Lord Takatou!

17:15.830 --> 17:17.670
Cuddle, cuddle! Cuddley-cuddle!

17:20.290 --> 17:23.380
But guys... what do we do now?

17:23.380 --> 17:24.960
What should we do...

17:24.960 --> 17:26.750
That's a good question.

17:26.750 --> 17:29.080
How about we go up on the roof?

17:34.920 --> 17:37.710
The royal palace had a place
similar to this,

17:37.710 --> 17:39.830
so I thought we may find one here.

17:40.250 --> 17:43.500
Sorry, Hanakawa.
This can only hold five people.

17:43.710 --> 17:47.630
Why are you suddenly acting like
some sort of hotshot rich boy?!

17:47.630 --> 17:49.460
I just wanted to try saying it once.

17:49.460 --> 17:53.040
Do you truly believe this is
a good time for jokes?!

17:53.460 --> 17:57.380
But then again, it does seem
we won't all be able to ride.

17:57.380 --> 18:01.080
We can make do, so you all can ride!

18:01.080 --> 18:02.130
Eh?!

18:02.130 --> 18:04.670
Kay, catch ya later!

18:11.330 --> 18:13.960
So, why'd we stay behind?

18:14.250 --> 18:16.670
Oh, it's a simply thing, really.

18:16.670 --> 18:19.460
I've been researching it for a while.

18:24.380 --> 18:26.130
This can make us fly?!

18:26.130 --> 18:28.330
According to my calculations, yes!

18:28.630 --> 18:30.420
What should I do?

18:30.420 --> 18:32.210
If you hold on tight to my master,

18:32.210 --> 18:34.920
it should be possible for us
to get enough buoyancy.

18:34.920 --> 18:35.750
What?!

18:36.130 --> 18:37.290
Like this?

18:39.210 --> 18:43.040
Like, you really don't hesitate to cross
these boundaries do you, Takatou-kun?!

18:43.040 --> 18:46.000
If I can't find a good reason to,
then I don't hold back.

18:46.000 --> 18:49.500
Ooh yes, go for it! Cling harder!

18:46.000 --> 18:49.500
If this is what had to happen why did
Takatou-kun get left behind?!

18:49.500 --> 18:52.250
Get closer, mm-hmm!

18:49.500 --> 18:52.250
Carol or Ninomiya-san would've
worked too, right?

18:52.250 --> 18:53.920
About that...

18:53.920 --> 18:56.670
I thought this way might be more fun!

18:56.670 --> 18:59.500
I should've just went ahead and
sent you to Buddha, huh?!

19:03.380 --> 19:05.790
Here I go!

19:20.830 --> 19:24.250
Okay, what happens now?

19:24.250 --> 19:29.000
We've been through a whole lot,
and I'd like to take a breather for now.

19:29.000 --> 19:31.960
I mean, I can't really come up
with anything right now.

19:31.960 --> 19:34.630
Then I will guide you to a nearby city.

19:34.630 --> 19:37.170
We can't possibly rest here.

19:37.170 --> 19:39.460
What? Where's Hanakawa-kun?

19:39.790 --> 19:41.630
Now that you mention it, he's not here.

19:41.630 --> 19:43.330
Maybe he ran away?

19:43.330 --> 19:46.750
Well, I have no obligation to
bring him anywhere so it's fine.

19:46.750 --> 19:50.290
And it didn't feel like he wanted to
go back to our world anyways.

19:50.290 --> 19:53.500
Are you okay with us tagging along?

19:53.500 --> 19:56.080
It's fine, but I only want to
get enough energy

19:56.080 --> 19:59.290
for me and Dannoura-san to
return home, you know?

19:59.290 --> 20:02.170
What? What's that all about?!

20:02.170 --> 20:05.250
Even though I don't know if
just the two of us can get back,

20:05.250 --> 20:08.210
I can't take responsibility for
two more people.

20:08.420 --> 20:11.000
You sure are matter-of-fact, Takatou-kun.

20:11.000 --> 20:13.000
I'm okay with all that.

20:13.000 --> 20:14.290
Same here.

20:14.290 --> 20:16.920
I just want to go along with you two
for as long as possible.

20:16.920 --> 20:19.920
Say, I'm getting sleepy,

20:19.920 --> 20:22.580
so will you carry me, Dannoura-san?

20:22.580 --> 20:24.500
And how'm I supposed to do that?

20:24.500 --> 20:26.830
I can carry you on my back
if you don't mind me doing so!

20:26.830 --> 20:28.960
Don't spoil him like that!

20:28.960 --> 20:32.000
We can't let anything happen
to Takatou-kun!

20:32.000 --> 20:35.130
Wow Ryouko, you're so serious!

20:38.460 --> 20:39.830
Yogiri-san!

20:41.580 --> 20:43.130
Who're you?

20:43.130 --> 20:45.880
I'm Risley!

20:45.880 --> 20:47.580
Do you want something from me?

20:47.580 --> 20:49.540
Marry me, please!

20:49.540 --> 20:51.250
Sorry, I can't.

20:51.250 --> 20:52.920
I was instantly rejected!

20:52.920 --> 20:56.170
Risley, there's no way you'll
get what you want

20:56.170 --> 20:58.170
if you just spring it on him like that.

20:58.170 --> 20:59.630
Theodisia-san?

20:59.830 --> 21:02.580
I am pleased to see you again,
Lord Takatou.

21:02.580 --> 21:04.540
You found your little sister?

21:04.540 --> 21:08.960
There's a somewhat complicated
story about that...

21:09.170 --> 21:13.710
This is for you,
so please listen to my request!

21:13.960 --> 21:17.170
Is this... the Philosopher's Stone?

21:17.170 --> 21:18.290
Yes!

21:23.670 --> 21:25.540
You can't be serious!

21:25.540 --> 21:27.420
What is the meaning of this?!

21:27.960 --> 21:31.040
How can you kill such a thing?!

21:32.080 --> 21:36.170
We cannot ignore a monster
capable of this!

22:13.670 --> 22:15.630
I cannot stand to stay with them!

22:15.630 --> 22:19.460
I'm going to build my own
parallel world harem!

22:20.630 --> 22:23.880
Starting next episode,
Hanakawa's cheat ability will be so sexy,

22:21.580 --> 22:26.130
<b>Hanakawa's Cheat Ability is So Sexy,
No Ladies in this Other World Can Resist Moaning!</b>

22:23.880 --> 22:26.750
no ladies in this otherworld
can resist moaning!

22:39.580 --> 22:43.920
Yogiri-kun, you should use
your power as you please.

22:45.920 --> 22:50.130
If you don't like some guy,
I think it's fine to just murder 'im!

22:51.000 --> 22:54.460
However, you shouldn't follow

22:54.460 --> 23:00.130
rational and smart ways of thinking
that someone else came up with.

23:00.460 --> 23:05.130
Don't get fixated on conventional justice
and other thoughts and beliefs.

23:05.420 --> 23:07.250
When it comes to using your powers,

23:07.250 --> 23:09.460
the best rules are ones
you come up with yourself.

23:20.210 --> 23:21.920
Look how close they are!

23:21.920 --> 23:23.880
Happily ever after!
